261    * Analyze names for typical system objects. Identifier is beginning SYS_ for system generated object and $ or #,
262    * which may occur anywhere in the name of system objects. Oracle strongly discourages the use of the symbols $ and # in object names.
263    *
264    * Usually used in NOT constructs like WHERE NOT otap_string.is_sys_object(object_name, 1).
