 18    * @param p_table_name The name of the table, taken as is. Case sensitive.
 19    * @param o_error Error information, if any, on the test executed.
 20    * @param p_schema The schema to use. If NULL current schema is used. Case sensitive.
 21    * @param p_expected_result The expected test result as number. Default is test passed. See otap_constants.
 22    *
 23    * @return The test result as number, either otap_constants.OTAP_NUM_TEST_PASSED, otap_constants.OTAP_NUM_TEST_FAILED or otap_constants.OTAP_NUM_TEST_UNDEFINED.
