1024  	/** FUNCTION otap_test.generate_package_tests
1025  	* Generates the test scripts for the packages of the given schema with the current available
1026  	* otap schema functions. Provides set (schema), group (package) and name (package function and procedures) management.
1027  	* Limited to line size 4000 but not to rows, like DBMS_OUTPUT. It is up to you how
