SQL> -- generic exists template
SQL> -- @type@ represents the object type as defined in the database, see OTAP_IDENTIFIERS_V.
SQL> -- @object@ represents the simple object name without schema. Columns or package functions/procedures use TEMPLATE_EXISTSX.
SQL> -- @schema@ represents the schema of the object.
